<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Jan-Sept cargo load factor down.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Jan-Sept cargo load factor down.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo said its January-September cargo load factor slipped to 67.9 percent or 0.3 percentage points below the comparable figure for last year.</p>
<p>Other details for Jan-Sept cargo compared to 1995 include</p>
<p>Freight load factor			    67.9   down 0.3 pct pts</p>
<p>Total freight/post (1,000 tonnes)	  1,222    up 3.3 pct</p>
<p>Available freight-tonne kilometres (million) 6,924    up 3.9 pct</p>
<p>Revenue freight-tonne kilometres   (million) 4,699    up 3.4 pct</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsdesk Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
